## Reviewer disagreed (not applied)
- Deleting U+200B, and promoting 003 Q16–Q20 to headings (sr-a 28, sr-b 12). The Korean source carries those zero-width spaces and those Q-lines as body text. Matching it is what the checker enforces. 015 therefore has no textual change.
- "godinu dana" / "jedne godine" / "jednog meseca" / "četiri" / "dve trećine" wherever that drops a numeral the checker counts. The sr lexicon only has jedan/jedna/jedno, dva/dve, tri (and the ordinals). Accusative "jednu" and genitive "jedne/jednog" are not counted. The digit was restored in those spots.
- Dropping "član 10" from the business-tax link label. The URL is the general rate (flno=3), which the new label says; the digit 10 has to remain because the Korean anchor text is 제10조.
- Reformatting "TWD 1.57M" (sr-a 40). Standing skip.
- 006 "U svakom slučaju" and 007 "u svakom slučaju u roku od 5 godina" are the right Serbian for "anyway" / "in any event", not the "in each case" calque.
- 010 "do 3 puta" is a multiplier ("up to three times"), not "tri načina".
